# Normalise the working tree to LF regardless of core.autocrlf, which is true at
# system level on the current dev machine.
#
# Prettier's endOfLine default is "lf". Without this, a fresh clone checks out CRLF
# and `npm run format:check` fails on every file — a false failure that would make
# the CLAUDE.md definition of done unreachable until someone reformatted the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf
